Message-ID: <c0o7_Der5Gk.mkasaCX0BgAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <c0o7_Der5Gk.H8sUylHpBgAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
References: <c0o7_Der5Gk.H8sUylHpBgAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rqtl2-disc/c/c0o7_Der5Gk/m/mkasaCX0BgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The "do" cross type is not appropriate, but there's a cross type "dof1" that should work. The founder genotypes would include 9 founders: the 8 CC founders plus the other parent, so for your data the B6 strain would be repeated.

karl

