References: <-aPg7R2GrUs.-wKB6o2qBQAJ@rqtl2-disc.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rqtl2-disc/c/-aPg7R2GrUs/m/YrxIqgT4AQAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The coding of the SNP genotypes won't have any effect on QTL mapping results, and we haven't implemented anything to do any re-coding.

karl

