I've now built R/qtl2 for R version 3.6, at http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran

If you upgrade R from version 3.5 to 3.6, you need to reinstall all packages. You can reinstall the R/qtl2 packages with:

     update.packages(ask=FALSE, checkBuilt=TRUE,
                     repos="http://rqtl.org/qtl2cran")

Upgrade the rest of your packages with:

     update.packages(ask=FALSE, checkBuilt=TRUE)

karl

